# Vendored sphere_view package.
#
# `build/` is not just build output here — it is also where the prebuilt OpenCV
# static libraries live, which android/CMakeLists.txt links against. It is 213 MB
# per ABI and is deliberately not committed. Regenerate it once with:
#
#     cd packages/sphere_view && tools/build_native_mobile.sh --android
#
# See BUILD.md §0C.
packages/sphere_view/build/
packages/sphere_view/.dart_tool/
packages/sphere_view/android/.cxx/
packages/sphere_view/android/local.properties
packages/sphere_view/spikes/spike_a_opencv/work/
packages/sphere_view/spikes/spike_a_opencv/out/
packages/sphere_view/example/build/
packages/sphere_view/example/.dart_tool/
packages/sphere_view/example/android/.gradle/

